Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party source code is vendored into this repository. All third-party
components are consumed as declared dependencies and remain under their own
licenses:

  Frontend runtime and build dependencies
    Declared in frontend/package.json (React, Vite, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS,
    Radix UI, Zustand, KaTeX, Yjs and others). Predominantly MIT and
    Apache-2.0 licensed.

  Backend runtime and build dependencies
    Declared in backend/pom.xml (Spring Boot, MyBatis-Plus, JJWT,
    springdoc-openapi and others). Predominantly Apache-2.0 licensed.

Run `npm ls --all` in frontend/ or `mvn dependency:tree` in backend/ for the
authoritative, versioned dependency list. The license texts of those
components are not reproduced here; they are available from their respective
upstream projects.


